                "ImageUrl": "https://www.digikey.ie//mm.digikey.com/Volume0/opasdata/d220001/derivates/3/020/850/223/DM3AT-SF-PEJM5_tmb.jpg",
                "SeoDescription": "PC card sockets are connectors designed to receive card type memory such as CFast, SIM, PCMCIA, Compact Flash, CardBus, ExpressCard, and SD, allowing for regular removal and insertion via hinged lid, push-pull and auto eject methods. They are available in surface, board, screw, straddle, snap-in, and edge mount as well as free-hanging and hand gripped versions.",
